":"말이에요.","meaning":"就是那个","explanation":"말：就是那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"10","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이에요","audio":"/audio/eb49aaa0268bb74f5d29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"e08ac8ae394c7197","term":"미니","zh":"迷你裙","audio":"/audio/e08ac8ae394c719774b0.mp3","entryId":"15758","definition":"一种长度只及膝盖以上的，极短的西式裙子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行，时尚，时髦","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"某个事物受人欢迎，在整个社会广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"就是那个","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"强调前面所指的对象。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/8527213ad53ec4b55430.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15758","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在迷你裙很流行啊。","咖啡上加了什么？","你的裙子是不是太短了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在迷你裙很流行啊。","你的裙子是不是太短了？","咖啡上加了什么？"],"answer":0}]}
